    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "A frontier tipster from a provincial setting sent a leaked frontier document to the national testing body, exposing a breach in the May 3 examination event. The institutional gatekeeper, acting on this disclosed evidence packet, referred the case to a boundary-enforcement agency, leading to the detention of those involved for crossing lines and the cancellation opening new possibilities. This swift escalation into investigative territory underscores a new path forward for exam integrity.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Explorer",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "how-0",
          "how-1",
          "how-2",
          "result-0"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.85
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "The re-examination scheduled for June 21 offers a second frontier attempt for aspirants after the closure of the original route. Following the digital border-crossing alert from a tipster at the threshold, the exam authority's referral to enforcement body led to arrests closing off movement. This event, a consequence of informant-submitted matching materials, marks a chance to reset and explore anew in the national testing ground.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Explorer",
        "fragments": [
          "how-4",
          "result-0",
          "how-1",
          "how-2",
          "how-3",
          "why-0",
          "result-2"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.82
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "In the examination jurisdiction of India, exposed insiders faced confinement following the initial examination event. A communication from an informant about the test that started the journey triggered a referral to the national investigative body, resulting in a law enforcement action. The event outcome includes a rescheduled test, providing a second attempt for a fresh start in this testing ground.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Explorer",
